sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant MA as Model Armor
    participant CO as Coordinator
    participant SP as Specialist
    participant RS as Redeem service
    participant TL as Tool
    participant LLM as Gemini
    U->>GW: message + JWT
    GW->>GW: verify JWT, correlation id
    GW->>FS: rate limit counters, create per-turn handle
    GW->>MA: screen input
    GW->>CO: stream request with identity and handle in state
    GW-->>U: SSE: status event (about 3 s)
    CO->>LLM: choose specialist
    CO->>SP: delegate
    SP->>LLM: plan tool call
    SP->>RS: redeem handle for tool audience
    RS-->>SP: scoped token
    SP->>TL: call (callbacks check role and arguments)
    TL-->>SP: result (screened)
    SP->>LLM: write answer
    SP-->>GW: partial and final events
    alt KB answer
        GW->>GW: hold text, validate citations, then release
    else other answer
        GW->>GW: stream, screen completed text, retract if blocked
    end
    GW-->>U: SSE: token, tool_status, final
    GW->>FS: delete handle
    Note over GW,TL: Every hop writes an audit event and a trace span with the same correlation id
